  "dek": "Chen improves in second, while a rising cutoff leaves two unchanged contenders outside provisional gold.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition — ARC-AGI-2\nKajetan Schweighofer reaches 12th as the provisional gold cutoff rises. Chen improves in second; Tufa remains first. Khaotic Sethesis and Arcnights sit outside gold at unchanged scores. Inside: Gladstone025, kakuteki and Odd Dice’s climbs, plus ARC Prize’s Haiku evaluation and its completion warning.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-14-evening-arc-2",
